WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.970
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:32.350
<b>Episode Four
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 4</b>

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.640
Alright.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.770
It's very simple.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.640
Ah Jie's subdued the Summoner.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.680
That's the danger dealt 
with. We're done here.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.060
Not so fast!

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.270
Hand the cat over, and only then is it over!

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.670
Sorry, but until she's all healed up,

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.180
I'm keeping the cat.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.950
After that,

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:55.860
you can work it out.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.100
You punk, you kidding me?!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.490
Hey, calm down.

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:04.390
It's a friendly negotiation.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.220
After all, you guys are injured,

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.680
and I've never been one to kick 
someone while they're down.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.430
Missy!

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.140
Give it up.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:23.810
Ah Jie, you'll soon find out.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:25.750
You've picked the wrong friend

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.730
and the wrong enemy.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.890
Missy!

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.520
Missy!

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:39.330
It's fine.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.410
Breaking news. This just in.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:54.800
Today's berserk animal commotion 
has finally been contained.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:03:00.770
All the animals that escaped have been 
accounted for and taken back to the zoo.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:03.810
The cause is still under investigation.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:07.720
This day is being referred to by some 
as the animals' independence day.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.200
Please stay tuned for further information.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.250
So, aside from humans,

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.080
animals can be summoners too, huh?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.640
Of course.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.820
Even the most unremarkable cats, 
dogs, crickets, even cockroaches,

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.430
could be summoners.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.520
I knew a lot of animal 
summoners back in the day.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.980
A mammoth summoner,

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.800
a turtle summoner,

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.160
even a skunk summoner.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.950
Right! The most amazing 
of them all is my brother!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.560
He's the coolest!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.940
But then...

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:04.000
So that means you are here 
to find your brother, right?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.910
After he left,

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.810
I followed his tracks and 
made it to this city.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.880
Because of my injuries, I lost 
my summoning powers for a time.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.970
It was Ah Jie who saved me while 
I was wandering the streets.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.540
What was that earlier today, though?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:24.120
My brother seems to be avoiding me,

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:27.090
so I thought... if I can't find him,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.840
I might as well make a huge 
ruckus, put on a show,

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.720
so that he'll notice me.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.940
Alright. You did put on a huge show.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.510
Sorry.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.700
It's fine.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.400
You'll find your brother.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.300
Don't overthink it.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.940
Before that happens, I'll do what 
I can to nurse you back to health

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:50.970
and fill your stomach.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.680
Thanks, Ah Jie!

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.040
Yeah. What do you want for dinner?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.420
I want grilled fish!

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.160
Pork bone ramen!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.190
And pork cutlet, too!

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:01.860
You got it!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.620
Who is it?

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.470
Coming.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:52.640
Pardon us.

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:55.700
Who are you...

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.600
Per our master's orders,

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:02.430
we're here to invite all of you 
to Missy's residence for dinner.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:05.180
Sorry, but I'm kinda busy.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.710
Let go!

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:13.010
Such a heartwarming invitation...

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.380
What a huge helicopter...

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.060
We're here.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.020
Welcome to our humble abode.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.920
You freaking plant!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.350
What do you two want?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.880
What are you afraid of? We're 
just having dinner together!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.170
Come with me.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.680
Hurry up!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.630
Our master's waiting inside!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:37.130
How big is this manor?

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.350
Who's your master? Bruce Wayne?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.560
What is that?

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.300
What are you so surprised for?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.130
These are our manor's security cameras.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.300
We have electric eel fences set up, too.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.390
It all runs on spiritual energy. 
Helps the environment out.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:59.680
These are our servants.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.220
They take care of our yardwork.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.970
What about this guy who's taking a piss?

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.640
That's our gardener. He's watering 
and applying fertilizer.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.910
Hold your horses.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:24.020
Our chef's working the grill right now.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.430
Are all these summoned spirits?

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.210
All these spirits of different elements...

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.770
How many Summoners do you have here?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.430
Just one.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.040
What?

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:37.720
Come inside.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.810
You'll get to meet him very soon.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.060
So magnificent.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.040
Must be so nice to be rich.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.060
Don't you disrespect our goddess!

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.160
This is a statue of the first 
leader of the Watchers!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.860
What's so incredible about that?

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.420
You! Shut up! Shut up! 
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.350
What was that?!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:27.310
You little! You little! You little!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.520
Ah Jie.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.890
Ah Jie.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.540
Did you guys hear that just now?

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.920
Ah Jie.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.120
Ah Jie.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.220
Ah Jie.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.140
What's the matter?

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.550
It's fine. I was just spacing out.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.330
Don't daydream so much, kid.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:26.380
You should take better care of yourself.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:49.190
Welcome, young Summoners.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.560
I am Harlan.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.640
Sorry I couldn't receive you myself.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.400
Our master is the head 
of the Black Rose family.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.240
A renowned entrepreneur.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.640
He has his hands in all kinds 
of businesses, big and small.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.200
Hardly worthy of mentioning.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.370
Wouldn't you agree I have a 
lovely granddaughter, though?

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:10.710
Grandpa...

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:16.210
He seems like a regular old man to me.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.590
Let's not stand around.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:21.220
Come, sit.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.830
What incredible aura.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:32.220
I apologize for inviting you 
on this little excursion.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:36.110
But time waits for no one, and we must meet.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:39.140
Please let me start from the beginning.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.270
All things have a spirit.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.950
The legend goes that the source of 
all spirits is a single crystal.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.060
A god.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.290
A devil.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:57.330
Human Summoners have waged 
countless wars over it.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.150
These wars lasted several centuries.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.840
Since ancient times,

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.360
Summoners have been divided into two camps.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:11.100
One side passes down the power of nature.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.690
They let nature run its course and 
protect the balance of the world.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:17.800
They are called The Watchers.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.150
As for the other side,

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:23.650
they snatch up all summoning powers 
through whatever means necessary.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:24.610
They kill.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:25.910
They invade.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.910
They seek to take over this world 
with their endless desires.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:33.350
They are called The Destroyers.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:37.470
You are very lucky that we found you first.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.420
Perhaps this too is fate.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:44.250
Will you become a Watcher or a Destroyer?

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.890
This is a decision that all Summoners 
will have to make eventually.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.360
Light or darkness.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.520
Justice or evil.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.780
To watch or to destroy.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:00.390
Ah Jie, which side will you choose?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.120
I choose the Avengers.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.020
Then I choose the Justice League!

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.470
Be serious.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.750
Sorry, Master.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:13.180
First, all this fancy make-believe's 
got nothing to do with me.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:17.260
And also, my mom's always told me 
not to get involved with the mafia.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:21.180
My old man also told me that the 
mafia's well on its decline.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.880
All that violence has no future.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.430
You're the least serious of us, Ah Jie.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:29.350
Did they really tell you that?

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.390
From what I know,

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:34.560
your parents abandoned 
you when you were five.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.980
They disappeared without a trace.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:39.500
Ever since, you lived with fosters

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.230
until you were old enough 
to live on your own.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.820
You're a model student.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.400
You have two part time jobs.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:49.490
You dyed your hair to hide 
your natural blond hair color.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:53.140
You may seem like you have no desires and 
you want nothing to do with the world.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.600
But you must actually feel 
very uneasy on the inside.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.640
If my hunch is correct,

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:05.690
you probably still have a picture 
of your parents in your wallet.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.890
You think everything that has happened 
recently was all a coincidence.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.850
You summoned a goddess with ramen,

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.830
who awakened all of a sudden.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.670
Who is Dora?

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.940
And about your parents, too.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:24.140
You don't know anything 
about their identities.

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:30.530
Have you even thought that all 
this could be connected somehow?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.680
Mister, you're quite an amazing 
actor for how old you are.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.970
Here, this is Ah Jie's wallet.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:47.100
Let's take a look inside and see if 
there's that picture you just said.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:51.720
No way.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.630
There really is a picture in here.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.810
This kid with the blond hair.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.560
That's Ah Jie when he was little.

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:01.960
Yeah.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.400
So that means...

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.940
e-everything that you just said...!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.110
As for you, Miaowu.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:11.100
I know you've been searching 
for your brother.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:15.830
He's now a notorious criminal 
wanted all over the world.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.790
He's one of the Destroyers' 
dreadful assassins.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.390
That's how fate is.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:27.680
You may want to run from it, 
but it has chosen you long ago.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.220
Grandpa... That may be a 
little too much in one go.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.970
Exactly. Look at them!

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.310
All frozen up like idiots.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.230
That was my bad.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:45.220
How about this, then?

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.730
You guys can stay here at my 
Black Rose Manor for a few days.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.770
We'll have all the time to talk.

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.530
About the Summoners' past,

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.470
about right now, your backgrounds,

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:00.600
the future, and everything 
that you want to know.

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.000
No, we can't.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.100
Ah Jie's got school tomorrow.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.880
He has my permission.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.840
Don't forget.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:09.220
I'm the principal.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.880
What a scary old bastard.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:15.180
It's settled, then.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:18.430
Come and eat. The food is getting cold.

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:22.560
Alright!

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.470
Don't mind if I do!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:28.600
This is mine!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.780
Dora! You're exactly like 
how they described you.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.200
An old little fella.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.600
Even I can't tell what element you are.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.610
You must be a fine, incredible individual.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.040
Oh, not at all.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.680
I just really pay attention 
to my personal care!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.170
Ah, that's right.

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:50.770
I heard your true form is 
quite shockingly beautiful.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:52.120
Grandpa!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:52.680
Do show me if we get the chance.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:54.840
Of course! Of course!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.380
Now that I took a closer look, 
you're quite handsome too!

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.520
The Destroyers.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:07.600
The blood moon, the crows, and the 
abnormal fluctuation in spiritual power.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.390
I knew we were being watched.

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.600
You've been awfully quiet for 
years since our last battle.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:18.300
And to think you'd come knock on my door...

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:21.600
You must have learned 
some kind of new tricks.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.810
Very well.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:28.020
I'll make sure none of 
you are leaving tonight.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:57.000
Des... troy!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.770
This place isn't safe anymore.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.140
You guys leave first.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.720
What about you?

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.280
We'll just be in the way if we stay.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.380
Hana.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.490
Promise me.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.610
You must keep Ah Jie safe.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.250
Yeah.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.680
Come.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:44.380
The manor's... destroyed!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.430
Missy!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.310
Quick!

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.930
Run!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:08.970
Stop!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.960
Not happy about that?

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:23.270
Greenball!

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.470
Here!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:38.180
We'll fight her together!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:01.690
Brother!

00:22:04.610 --> 00:22:05.610
Is...

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:07.660
Is that you?

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:22.970
Why?

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:26.500
Miaowu!

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:45.880
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:58.710
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:04.230
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:09.220
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:14.220
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:19.210
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:24.260
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:29.260
